OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears as bikers use quarry
OL,4,Aas 'racetrack'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorcyclists using a working china
OL,7,Fclay quarry as "an enormous racetrack"
OL,8,Fare putting lives at risk, bosses have
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FThere have been more e-bikes and
OL,12,Fmotocross bikes driving across the
OL,13,Fprivately-owned Littlejohns Pit, near
OL,14,FRoche in Cornwall, this year than ever
OL,15,Fbefore, according to mining company
OL,16,FImerys.
OL,18,FMark Hewson, the company's UK lead,
OL,19,Fsaid motorcyclists using the 200 miles
OL,20,F(322km) of roads at the site had
OL,21,Ffrequently appeared unexpectedly in
OL,22,Ffront of 100-tonne haulage trucks.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
