OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears as bikers use quarry
OL,4,Aas 'racetrack'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If somebody on an out-of-control
OL,7,Fe-bike or motocross bike comes across
OL,8,Fthe trucks, there's only going to be
OL,9,Fone conclusion," he warned.
